      "text": "eToken.exe ( VVSup.exe ) is built with dynamic link DLL mode with MFC42.dll , so the .exe file will be small and the functions of the MFC42 libirary will be easily identified via the name import of the DLL. The name mangling rule of Microsoft VC ++ compiler reflects the class name, function name, parameter name, call type... of functions. IDA helps us to define the functions import by ordinal of MFC42.dll using the file mfc42.ids and mfc42.idt included with IDA.",
